                "Grain_Size_Value": "",
                "Grain_Size_Units": "",
                "Microstructural_Features": "the interfacial microstructure of the coating exhibits a mixture of Mg/Al with a thickness of 200–300 nm of intermetallic possibly Mg17Al12. no flaw like hair line cracks identified at the interface of the coating/substrate, instead, the open surface pores in the cast substrate were covered by the dense AA7075 coating, making a strong bonding between the AA7075 and AZ31B Mg alloy interface. no Mg2Al3 phase identified. The Mg17Al12 phase had a nano hardness of 4.36 nHV and an elastic modulus of 110.35, and the Mg2Al3 phase had those of 4.12 nHV and 88.58 GPa resp."
            },
            "Notes": "As-spray. Powder size and shape information, and coating process parameters in ref. 16."
